<title>NEW ZEALAND: Broadway 1st half profit NZ$8.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Broadway 1st half profit NZ$8.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
